# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Never commit the real file.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The scoring engine's base URL. Read by apps/web/next.config.ts and baked into
# the client bundle at BUILD time, so changing it requires a rebuild, not just
# an environment edit. Netlify needs the same value under
# Site configuration -> Environment variables.
#
# Note it is not a secret in the cryptographic sense — the browser has to call
# it, so it appears in the shipped JavaScript. Keeping it out of the repo stops
# it being indexed and scraped from source; it does not hide it from a visitor.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-scoring-engine.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contracts / keeper
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deployer address, and the password for the `spidey-deployer` foundry keystore.
ADDRESS=0x...
PASSWORD=...

# Explorer verification key, if verifying source.
verify=...
